I18n.add({fr:{"How to play":"Comment jouer",Skip:"Passer",Back:"Retour","Next ▶️":"Suivant ▶️","👍 Got it!":"👍 J'ai compris !","Your army shoots all by itself! Stop the enemy before it breaks in.":"Ton armée tire toute seule ! Arrête l'ennemi avant qu'il n'entre.","Slide your finger on the field to move your army. You can also hold ⬅️ ➡️, or use the arrow keys.":"Glisse ton doigt sur le terrain pour bouger ton armée. Tu peux aussi garder ⬅️ ➡️ appuyé, ou utiliser les flèches.","You are behind the wall! Tap or drag to move the cross-hair: your army shoots where it points. Hold ⬅️ ➡️ to look around.":"Tu es derrière le mur ! Touche ou glisse pour bouger le viseur : ton armée tire là où il vise. Garde ⬅️ ➡️ appuyé pour regarder autour.","Shoot a box to open it: a new weapon, more soldiers, a bigger wall or a shield.":"Tire sur une boîte pour l'ouvrir : une nouvelle arme, plus de soldats, un mur plus grand ou un bouclier.","The enemy breaks your wall first, then hits your ❤️. Don't let it reach zero!":"L'ennemi casse d'abord ton mur, puis touche ton ❤️. Ne le laisse pas tomber à zéro !","Knock out the King Tank to win the game. Tap the field to start!":"Mets KO le Roi des chars pour gagner la partie. Touche le terrain pour commencer !","Tap 2D, 3D or FPS at the top to see the battle another way. It goes on just as it was!":"Touche 2D, 3D ou FPS en haut pour voir la bataille autrement. Elle continue comme avant !"},"zh-HK":{"How to play":"點樣玩",Skip:"跳過",Back:"返轉頭","Next ▶️":"下一步 ▶️","👍 Got it!":"👍 明白！","Your army shoots all by itself! Stop the enemy before it breaks in.":"你嘅軍隊會自己射！喺敵人衝入嚟之前擋住佢哋。","Slide your finger on the field to move your army. You can also hold ⬅️ ➡️, or use the arrow keys.":"喺戰場度滑手指就可以移動你嘅軍隊。你都可以撳住 ⬅️ ➡️，或者用方向鍵。","You are behind the wall! Tap or drag to move the cross-hair: your army shoots where it points. Hold ⬅️ ➡️ to look around.":"你喺城牆後面！㩒或者拖就可以移動準星：你嘅軍隊會射去準星指住嘅地方。撳住 ⬅️ ➡️ 就可以睇吓周圍。","Shoot a box to open it: a new weapon, more soldiers, a bigger wall or a shield.":"射個箱就會打開：新武器、多啲士兵、更大嘅牆或者盾牌。","The enemy breaks your wall first, then hits your ❤️. Don't let it reach zero!":"敵人會先打爛你嘅牆，跟住打你嘅 ❤️。唔好畀佢跌到零！","Knock out the King Tank to win the game. Tap the field to start!":"打低坦克大王就贏！㩒戰場開始！","Tap 2D, 3D or FPS at the top to see the battle another way. It goes on just as it was!":"㩒上面嘅 2D、3D 或者 FPS，就可以換個角度睇場仗。場仗會照住咁繼續！"}});